{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-act-10-1","title":"Acts 10:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Cornelius, a devout man, being commanded by an angel, sends for Peter, 11 who by a vision is taught not to despise the Gentiles; 17 and is commanded by the Spirit to go with the messenger to Caesarea. 25 Cornelius shows the occasion of his sending for him. 34 As he preaches Christ to Cornelius and his company, 44 the Holy Ghost falls on them, and they are baptized.</p>\n<p>Cir. A.M. 4045. A.D. 41. in. 8:40; 21:8; 23:23,33; 25:1,13 a centurion. 22:25; 27:1,31,43; Mt 8:5-13; 27:54; Lu 7:2 Italian.The Italian band, or rather cohort, [speira ,] (a regiment sometimes consisting of from 555 to 1,105 infantry), is not unknown to the Roman writers, (See Tacitus;) and Gruter gives an inscription in which it is mentioned, which was found in the Forum Sempronii, on a fine marble table.</p>\n<p>27:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-10-2","title":"Acts 10:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>devout. 7,22; 2:5; 8:2; 13:50; 16:14; 22:12; Lu 2:25 one. 35; 9:31; 13:16,26; 1Ki 8:43; 2Ch 6:33; Job 1:1; Ps 102:15; Ec 7:18 Isa 59:19; Da 6:26; Re 15:4 with. 7; 16:15; 18:8; Ge 18:19; Jos 24:15; Job 1:5; Ps 101:6-8 which. 4,22,31; 9:36; Ps 41:1; Isa 58:7,8; Lu 7:4,5; Ro 15:26,27 2Co 9:8-15 and prayed. 9:11; Ps 25:5,8,9; 55:17; 86:3; *marg: Ps 88:1; 119:2; Pr 2:3-5; Da 6:10,16,20; Mt 7:7,8; Lu 18:1; Col 4:2 1Th 5:17; Jas 1:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-10-3","title":"Acts 10:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>saw. Job 4:15,16; Da 9:20,21 about. 30; 3:1; Mt 27:46; Lu 23:44-46 an. 5:19; 11:13; 12:7-11; 27:23; Lu 1:11; 2:10,11,13; Heb 1:4,14 Cornelius. 9:4; Ex 33:17; Isa 45:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-10-4","title":"Acts 10:4",